{"id":"bb62713ade4dcadf","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md","title":"Vector Bundle","display":"df-vector-bundle — Vector Bundle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vector-bundle","aliases":["58-df-vector-bundle","Vector Bundle"],"display":"df-vector-bundle — Vector Bundle","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-bundle.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[58-df-continuous-function]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vector-bundle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vector-bundle</span><span>Vector Bundle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vector-bundle — Vector Bundle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" href=\"?note=e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md\">../batch18/58-df-bundle.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"58-df-continuous-function\">58-df-continuous-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,k\\in V\">\\(p,E,X,\\tau_E,\\tau_X,k\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\omega\">\\(r\\in\\omega\\)</span>。固定域结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\">\\((k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2bc9d494c7bff68e\" href=\"?note=2bc9d494c7bff68e\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr A,\\mathscr L\">\\(\\mathscr A,\\mathscr L\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对本文件考虑的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:E\\to X\">\\(p:E\\to X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_x=p^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\">\\(E_x=p^{-1}[\\{x\\}]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{k^r\\}\\cup\\{E_x:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\mathscr A\">\\(\\{k^r\\}\\cup\\{E_x:x\\in X\\}\\subseteq\\mathscr A\\)</span>；各纤维及典型纤维采用该同一固定族给出的运算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\)</span> 使用该族，不在局部平凡化之间重选运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>典型纤维的运算为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{k^r}=\\{\\langle\\langle v,w\\rangle,\\{\\langle i,+_k(v(i),w(i))\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\rangle:v,w\\in k^r\\}\">\\(+_{k^r}=\\{\\langle\\langle v,w\\rangle,\\{\\langle i,+_k(v(i),w(i))\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\rangle:v,w\\in k^r\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot_{k^r}=\\{\\langle\\langle a,v\\rangle,\\{\\langle i,\\cdot_k(a,v(i))\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\rangle:a\\in k\\land v\\in k^r\\}\">\\(\\odot_{k^r}=\\{\\langle\\langle a,v\\rangle,\\{\\langle i,\\cdot_k(a,v(i))\\rangle:i\\in r\\}\\rangle:a\\in k\\land v\\in k^r\\}\\)</span>，并有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr L(k^r)=\\langle+_{k^r},\\odot_{k^r}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathscr L(k^r)=\\langle+_{k^r},\\odot_{k^r}\\rangle\\)</span>。正文中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+,\\odot\">\\(+,\\odot\\)</span> 分别为这两个运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定典型纤维拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{k^r}\">\\(\\tau_{k^r}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(k^r,\\tau_{k^r})\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(k^r,\\tau_{k^r})\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathbb R\">\\(k=\\mathbb R\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=\\mathbb C\">\\(k=\\mathbb C\\)</span> 时，它分别是实欧氏拓扑或由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d(v,w)=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in r}|v(i)-w(i)|^2}\">\\(d(v,w)=\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in r}|v(i)-w(i)|^2}\\)</span> 给出的拓扑；其他域保留所给拓扑，不附加未声明的标准性要求。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=x\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_1(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=z\">\\(\\operatorname{pr}_2(\\langle x,z\\rangle)=z\\)</span>；每处投影均限制在相应的积载体。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_X=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_X=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma(X,E)\">\\(\\Gamma(X,E)\\)</span> 相对于所固定的投影 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 和拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_X,\\tau_E\">\\(\\tau_X,\\tau_E\\)</span> 定义；其两个显示参数不改变。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b2e63b755a37f1dc\" href=\"?note=b2e63b755a37f1dc\" title=\"58-df-continuous-function\">58-df-continuous-function</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bundle}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bundle}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" href=\"?note=e1e5dca961f5c9ef\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md\">../batch18/58-df-bundle.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash \\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,k,r)\\leftrightarrow r\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(k^r,+,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,k^r,\\tau_{k^r})\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists\\phi_U\\;\\Biggl[x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(\\phi_U,p^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap p^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\},U\\times k^r,\\left\\{W\\subseteq U\\times k^r:\\forall\\langle u,z\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{k^r}\\;(u\\in O\\cap U\\land z\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{pr}_1\\circ\\phi_U=p\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[U]\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\bigl((\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ\\phi_U)\\upharpoonright E_u,E_u,k^r\\bigr)\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle}\\vdash \\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,k,r)\\leftrightarrow r\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(k,+_k,\\cdot_k,0_k,1_k)\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_k(k^r,+,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Bundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,k^r,\\tau_{k^r})\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists\\phi_U\\;\\Biggl[x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\!\\left(\\phi_U,p^{-1}[U],\\{O\\cap p^{-1}[U]:O\\in\\tau_E\\},U\\times k^r,\\left\\{W\\subseteq U\\times k^r:\\forall\\langle u,z\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{k^r}\\;(u\\in O\\cap U\\land z\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{pr}_1\\circ\\phi_U=p\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[U]\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\bigl((\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ\\phi_U)\\upharpoonright E_u,E_u,k^r\\bigr)\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}sections}\\vdash \\Gamma(X,E)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{s\\in E^X:p\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_X\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(s,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}sections}\\vdash \\Gamma(X,E)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{s\\in E^X:p\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_X\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(s,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>秩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 指每个纤维与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k^r\">\\(k^r\\)</span> 线性同构；这里不使用集合论的 rank 函数。</li>\n<li>两个线性局部平凡化在交集上给出取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}_r(k)\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}_r(k)\\)</span> 的转移函数，并满足余圈条件。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 是拓扑域，则连续截面在逐点运算下形成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(X,k)\">\\(C(X,k)\\)</span>-模；该结论需要相应的连续性假设。</li>\n<li>局部平凡化的同胚谓词现在显式携带总空间子空间拓扑与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times k^r\">\\(U\\times k^r\\)</span> 的乘积拓扑，符合上游五元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S\\)</span> 签名。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bundle.md","status":"resolved","id":"e1e5dca961f5c9ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bundle.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-field.md","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-function","status":"resolved","id":"b2e63b755a37f1dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-structure-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"2bc9d494c7bff68e",