z\\rangle\\in W\\;\\exists O\\in\\tau_X\\;\\exists V\\in\\tau_{k^r}\\;(u\\in O\\cap U\\land z\\in V\\land(O\\cap U)\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}\\right)\\land\\operatorname{pr}_1\\circ\\phi_U=p\\upharpoonright p^{-1}[U]\\land\\forall u\\in U\\;\\mathrm{LinIso}_k\\bigl((\\operatorname{pr}_2\\circ\\phi_U)\\upharpoonright E_u,E_u,k^r\\bigr)\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}vector\\text{-}bundle\\text{-}sections}\\vdash \\Gamma(X,E)\\coloneqq\\bigl\\{s\\in E^X:p\\circ s=\\mathrm{id}_X\\land\\mathrm{ContinuousFunction}_S(s,X,\\tau_X,E,\\tau_E)\\bigr\\}","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"k^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}_r(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"C(X,k)","display":false},{"tex":"U\\times k^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S","display":false}],"bytes":3905,"backlinks":[{"id":"3f045a36dba6b5ef","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$E,F,X,Y,B,\\pi,q,\\tau_E,\\tau_F,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,\\tau_B,h,f,b,n\\in V$。所有复向量丛采用 [[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]] 的固定纤维运算族，标量域为具有标准运算的 $\\mathbb C$。"},{"id":"eaa26a086cb6c5af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,L,\\tau_L,X,\\tau_X,k,1)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]])"},{"id":"904b0609d7cbf868","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"83a9a929ecea09d7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(p,E,\\tau_E,M,\\tau_M,\\mathbb C,r)$ is as in [[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md]], and $\\mathrm{Function}$ is as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]."},{"id":"2ee05b1995ae05f1","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97bfaddac2f220a7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{VectorBundle}_S(\\pi,E,\\tau_E,X,\\tau_X,\\mathbb C,r)$ is the scalar-field-sensitive predicate from [[58-df-vector-bundle]]"},{"id":"ebfeeba38e32e200","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-vector-bundle.md|58-df-vector-bundle]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["e1e5dca961f5c9ef","1eb4a89b005d9cda","592f9cfb66a507c2","b2e63b755a37f1dc","c4b4a825f2ea608d","2bc9d494c7bff68e","ca7fc3ab38a11801"]}